# Purpose
Explain how native support attribution, evidence, privacy, classification, lifecycle, agile planning, and delivery links work.

# Gotchas
- Do not paste secrets, raw prompts, private logs, or personal contact details into support records.
- Email delivery and managed uploads may depend on features enabled for the account.
- Agent, model, and build labels are diagnostic metadata; authenticated human attribution remains authoritative until a signed agent principal is available.
